* Unit testing\nprinciples
** DRY
*** Don't Repeat Yourself
*** Factor out shared\nsetup / helpers
** KISS
*** Keep It Simple
*** One clear assertion\nper behaviour
*** Readable over clever
** SRP
*** Single Responsibility
*** One reason to fail
*** Test one unit\nat a time
** YAGNI
*** You Aren't Gonna\nNeed It
*** No speculative tests
*** Test real behaviour
** Goal
*** Fast feedback
*** Trustworthy suite
*** Easy maintenance
